WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.380
[Low strings as the squad sets off]

00:02.400 --> 00:04.647
[Tracks rumble across the field]

00:04.667 --> 00:05.847
[Tank cannon fires]

00:05.867 --> 00:07.447
[Fire cracks beside the trench]

00:07.467 --> 00:08.547
[Distant fire at the mortar pit]

00:08.567 --> 00:10.947
[Mortar bursts across the trench line]

00:10.967 --> 00:13.680
[Helicopter rotors over the suspended vehicle]

00:13.700 --> 00:16.480
[Boats approach the shore]

00:16.500 --> 00:18.413
[Patrol ship fires across the harbour]

00:18.433 --> 00:21.413
[Jet engines climb over the harbour]

00:21.433 --> 00:23.980
[Impacts roll across the water]
